{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-catalog",
  "version": "0.35.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "DSH 插件/Skill 目录面板：卡片式列出全部插件与 Skill 与 MCP（官方/自写/第三方/混血四分类）、按会话日志统计 90 天内每个工具的调用次数/报错/耗时/涉及会话（子代理单独标记）、读运行期真相（Loader 的 fiberPhase 与声明层对账）、在卡片底部直接卸载插件 / 停用启用 / 删除 Skill（回收站可还原）/ 停用或删除 MCP 条目（两段式 + 备份 + 写后校验）、自定义标签 + AI 分类、每周缺口分析与安全审核、自写与混血一键备份到 GitHub 私有仓（双语 README，密钥命中即停）。官方插件入口保留不隐藏。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "LICENSE",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "plugin-manager",
    "catalog",
    "skills",
    "mcp",
    "observability"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/JHboy203/dsh-plugin-catalog.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/JHboy203/dsh-plugin-catalog#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/JHboy203/dsh-plugin-catalog/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.1 <0.3.0",
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  }
}
